      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Inclined-Plane Trick</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Slowing a fall so a human can time it</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"760\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"235\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"315\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"425\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"470\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"640\" y1=\"530\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"575\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"810\" y1=\"640\" x2=\"810\" y2=\"685\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"385\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"555\" y=\"620\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"725\" y=\"730\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"360\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">distance each beat</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"850\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"905\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Running totals: 1, 4, 9, 16 ...</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Those are the squares of 1, 2, 3, 4.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"995\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Distance grows with time SQUARED.</text></svg>"
