      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Why Does It Stop?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The hidden force at work</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"300\" width=\"800\" height=\"120\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"375\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">BOOK</text><line x1=\"600\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"880\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><polygon points=\"880,345 920,360 880,375\" fill=\"#10b981\"/><text x=\"740\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">motion</text><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"470\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"470\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><polygon points=\"260,455 220,470 260,485\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"520\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">friction pushes back</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A real force slows it,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">not a \"desire\" to rest</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Friction is the invisible force behind the slowdown."
